Upstream PR: https://github.com/vyperlang/vyper/pull/5350
Status: open (draft)

Reject a subscript of a pop() result whose index can write a variable the
base reads, or makes a risky call (CompilerPanic "risky overlap"). The pin
has no subscript overlap check, so this also brings the read/write overlap
helpers (_subscript_read_write_overlap and the risky-call walk).

